  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Delivery of Peace and Security in Nigeria - SDPS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SDPS project will enhance the public&#x2019;s understanding of the drivers of contemporary insecurity in Nigeria through countering sensationalist narratives with evidence-based analysis; equipping local, national, and development stakeholders with a timely understanding of conflict dynamics and peacebuilding alternatives; and influencing positive policymaking to achieve sustainable peace in the country. Ultimately, the project will strengthen the nexus between knowledge-creation, informed public pressure, and responsive policy decision-making in addressing insecurity and conflict in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
